{"id": "dialogue:35629ca54852e5b6", "source": "でも、すこしは……", "text": "하지만，조금은…", "review": "교차 검토 필요", "occurrences": [{"id": "ADVDATA/APPEND/APPEND.BIN#0061"}]}
